WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.925
Clean water, air, and contaminated sites.

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:07.387
Federal contaminated sites number in the thousands.

00:00:07.387 --> 00:00:11.287
Cleanup costs are estimated in the tens of billions.

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:13.625
Progress has been glacial.
